WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.440
So, there is an app that literally pays

00:00:01.480 --> 00:00:05.600
you to watch TV. I'm not talking about

00:00:03.440 --> 00:00:08.080
watching ads for a penny. I mean, real

00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:10.080
shows, sports, stuff you would actually

00:00:08.080 --> 00:00:13.160
watch. So, I signed up, they mailed me

00:00:10.080 --> 00:00:14.400
this little sensor, and I tested it out

00:00:13.160 --> 00:00:16.560
this month to find out two things.

00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:18.440
Number one, would they really pay? And

00:00:16.560 --> 00:00:20.360
number two, is it worth your time? So,

00:00:18.440 --> 00:00:22.200
let me show you exactly what happened.

00:00:20.360 --> 00:00:23.560
There are a few drawbacks and a few

00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:25.320
potential privacy concerns you should

00:00:23.560 --> 00:00:27.720
know about, too, which I'll get to in a

00:00:25.320 --> 00:00:29.040
moment. So, first up, MediaProbe, or m

00:00:27.720 --> 00:00:31.720
panel, as it's called in certain

00:00:29.040 --> 00:00:34.080
countries, is a media research company.

00:00:31.720 --> 00:00:36.000
How it works is you hold a uh small

00:00:34.080 --> 00:00:38.880
wireless sensor that measures your

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:41.040
body's reaction, your galvanic skin

00:00:38.880 --> 00:00:43.480
response, they call it. Basically, tiny

00:00:41.040 --> 00:00:45.160
changes in your skin as you react to

00:00:43.480 --> 00:00:47.920
what you're watching. And then companies

00:00:45.160 --> 00:00:50.960
and TV networks pay MediaProbe for this

00:00:47.920 --> 00:00:53.055
data to see how audiences actually feel

00:00:50.960 --> 00:00:54.560
about their content. And then they uh in

00:00:53.055 --> 00:00:56.960
[music] theory pass along a portion of

00:00:54.560 --> 00:00:58.280
that income to viewers like you and me.

00:00:56.960 --> 00:01:00.160
The first drawback you need to know

00:00:58.280 --> 00:01:03.040
about is that MediaProbe is by

00:01:00.160 --> 00:01:04.480
application only. My guess is that's

00:01:03.040 --> 00:01:06.160
because there's a real cost to do the

00:01:04.480 --> 00:01:07.360
company in sending out these sensors,

00:01:06.160 --> 00:01:09.520
and they want to make sure their

00:01:07.360 --> 00:01:11.440
panelists meet the uh demographic and

00:01:09.520 --> 00:01:13.440
viewing habits that their clients are

00:01:11.440 --> 00:01:15.240
looking for, and that you'll actually

00:01:13.440 --> 00:01:17.120
participate once they send it to you.

00:01:15.240 --> 00:01:18.960
But, for the prospect of getting paid to

00:01:17.120 --> 00:01:21.000
watch TV, sure, [music] I'm willing to

00:01:18.960 --> 00:01:22.640
jump through a few hoops. In my case, I

00:01:21.000 --> 00:01:25.200
even had to get on like a 5-minute call

00:01:22.640 --> 00:01:26.920
with their team to verify I was game to

00:01:25.200 --> 00:01:28.280
test this out. If you want to apply,

00:01:26.920 --> 00:01:29.760
I'll drop the link below, but stick

00:01:28.280 --> 00:01:31.280
around because the earnings and the

00:01:29.760 --> 00:01:33.400
downsides you should probably hear

00:01:31.280 --> 00:01:34.760
first. Now, once you're approved for

00:01:33.400 --> 00:01:37.320
MediaProbe, you're going to start to get

00:01:34.760 --> 00:01:39.160
these session invitations in your inbox.

00:01:37.320 --> 00:01:41.280
Some of the ones I was invited to

00:01:39.160 --> 00:01:43.080
included uh Fear Factor, Top Chef, the

00:01:41.280 --> 00:01:46.200
Winter Olympics, Fox and Friends, and

00:01:43.080 --> 00:01:47.800
even a Mr. Beast YouTube video. And this

00:01:46.200 --> 00:01:50.200
is drawback number two. You don't get to

00:01:47.800 --> 00:01:52.280
pick. You can't just turn on the TV and

00:01:50.200 --> 00:01:54.720
expect them to pay you. It has to be one

00:01:52.280 --> 00:01:57.120
of their assigned shows, which I've been

00:01:54.720 --> 00:01:58.800
getting like five to 10 invites a month,

00:01:57.120 --> 00:02:00.800
but it still took a while to connect

00:01:58.800 --> 00:02:03.120
with one where I could commit to

00:02:00.800 --> 00:02:05.360
watching it at the given airtime. Now,

00:02:03.120 --> 00:02:07.440
each invite shows you how long you're

00:02:05.360 --> 00:02:10.200
supposed to watch and how much it pays.

00:02:07.440 --> 00:02:12.240
Generally, Media Probe offers about $5

00:02:10.200 --> 00:02:14.880
per hour of watch time, sometimes a

00:02:12.240 --> 00:02:16.040
little bit higher, which isn't a bad gig

00:02:14.880 --> 00:02:18.480
if you were going to be watching

00:02:16.040 --> 00:02:21.000
anyways, but is never going to add up to

00:02:18.480 --> 00:02:22.880
a full-time income. That Mr. Beast video

00:02:21.000 --> 00:02:25.520
was actually the first one that I signed

00:02:22.880 --> 00:02:27.320
up for. You start the session in the

00:02:25.520 --> 00:02:30.200
Media Probe app. You attach these little

00:02:27.320 --> 00:02:31.600
electrode readers to the tracker. You

00:02:30.200 --> 00:02:34.080
stick the sensor on your hand, and then

00:02:31.600 --> 00:02:35.640
you leave it on for the duration. And

00:02:34.080 --> 00:02:37.320
they give you these little straps too to

00:02:35.640 --> 00:02:38.840
help hold it on. Now, here's the third

00:02:37.320 --> 00:02:40.600
drawback you should know about. To

00:02:38.840 --> 00:02:42.520
verify that you're actually watching

00:02:40.600 --> 00:02:44.760
what you say you are, Media Probe asks

00:02:42.520 --> 00:02:46.600
you to enable the microphone on your

00:02:44.760 --> 00:02:48.360
phone so [music] we can hear the audio

00:02:46.600 --> 00:02:50.640
from the show and then sync that with

00:02:48.360 --> 00:02:53.360
your reaction data. Now, when the show's

00:02:50.640 --> 00:02:55.080
over, the app uploads your sensor data,

00:02:53.360 --> 00:02:57.240
and you usually have to answer a few

00:02:55.080 --> 00:02:59.400
questions, sometimes about what ads you

00:02:57.240 --> 00:03:01.400
remember seeing or what you liked or

00:02:59.400 --> 00:03:03.200
didn't like about what you just watched.

00:03:01.400 --> 00:03:05.400
I've gotten paid as soon as the next

00:03:03.200 --> 00:03:07.360
day, which brings me to drawback number

00:03:05.400 --> 00:03:09.959
four. At the time of this recording,

00:03:07.360 --> 00:03:11.600
Media Probe only pays in gift cards.

00:03:09.959 --> 00:03:13.360
Now, to their credit, they've got

00:03:11.600 --> 00:03:16.160
hundreds to choose from, but if you were

00:03:13.360 --> 00:03:18.519
hoping for direct cash to your bank or

00:03:16.160 --> 00:03:20.320
Venmo or PayPal, you're out of luck. I

00:03:18.519 --> 00:03:22.120
always end up picking Amazon because I

00:03:20.320 --> 00:03:24.120
know I can just add it to my account. I

00:03:22.120 --> 00:03:26.640
know I'll use it eventually. So, yes,

00:03:24.120 --> 00:03:28.280
Media Probe really does pay, which is

00:03:26.640 --> 00:03:29.959
pretty cool. Now, I actually had one

00:03:28.280 --> 00:03:33.000
session get denied cuz I didn't complete

00:03:29.959 --> 00:03:34.440
the full watch time. It was a World Cup

00:03:33.000 --> 00:03:36.040
match where I was supposed to leave the

00:03:34.440 --> 00:03:37.920
the post-game show on for like at least

00:03:36.040 --> 00:03:40.120
30 minutes, and I probably cut it off

00:03:37.920 --> 00:03:41.880
after 10 or 15. A little warning in the

00:03:40.120 --> 00:03:43.720
app would have been nice, like, "Hey,

00:03:41.880 --> 00:03:45.519
you're about to quit your session early.

00:03:43.720 --> 00:03:47.519
Are you sure you want to do that?" But

00:03:45.519 --> 00:03:49.160
after I politely emailed customer

00:03:47.519 --> 00:03:50.560
support, they did end up crediting me

00:03:49.160 --> 00:03:52.120
for the session, which would have been

00:03:50.560 --> 00:03:53.800
well within their right to deny since

00:03:52.120 --> 00:03:55.960
technically I didn't follow their

00:03:53.800 --> 00:03:57.920
instructions. Now while you're in these

00:03:55.960 --> 00:04:00.160
sessions your screen shows these thumbs

00:03:57.920 --> 00:04:02.760
up thumbs down reaction buttons. So in

00:04:00.160 --> 00:04:04.360
addition to the biometric data that the

00:04:02.760 --> 00:04:06.200
little device is collecting you can

00:04:04.360 --> 00:04:07.720
literally smash that like button if you

00:04:06.200 --> 00:04:09.440
see something that you like. Like when

00:04:07.720 --> 00:04:11.560
the US scored in that World Cup match I

00:04:09.440 --> 00:04:12.600
was like boom boom boom boom boom

00:04:11.560 --> 00:04:13.487
only to have it called back for

00:04:12.600 --> 00:04:13.520
offsides. Okay,

00:04:13.487 --> 00:04:15.840
>> [laughter]

00:04:13.520 --> 00:04:18.959
>> smash the thumbs down. But the app does

00:04:15.840 --> 00:04:20.880
get kind of unhappy when you leave that

00:04:18.959 --> 00:04:23.840
screen for any reason. So it might make

00:04:20.880 --> 00:04:25.960
sense to install Media Probe on an old

00:04:23.840 --> 00:04:27.919
phone device you're no longer using so

00:04:25.960 --> 00:04:30.440
you can still text or otherwise use your

00:04:27.919 --> 00:04:32.440
main phone while you're watching. If you

00:04:30.440 --> 00:04:34.040
want to give it a shot not a lot of risk

00:04:32.440 --> 00:04:35.720
or cost associated with it. The

00:04:34.040 --> 00:04:38.360
application link is in the description

00:04:35.720 --> 00:04:39.760
below. In total I made 10 bucks from Mr.

00:04:38.360 --> 00:04:41.653
Beast and 30 bucks from watching a

00:04:39.760 --> 00:04:43.320
couple World Cup games and that's

00:04:41.653 --> 00:04:45.520
[music] the best advice I can give when

00:04:43.320 --> 00:04:47.560
it comes to Media Probe. Use it for the

00:04:45.520 --> 00:04:49.720
content you were going to watch anyway.

00:04:47.560 --> 00:04:51.680
Cool way to get paid for that. Otherwise

00:04:49.720 --> 00:04:53.080
your time is much better spent pursuing

00:04:51.680 --> 00:04:54.960
a side hustle with higher earning

00:04:53.080 --> 00:04:58.080
potential like any of the options I

00:04:54.960 --> 00:04:58.080
share in this video.

